    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vape Shop Simulator is a first-person simulation game where you sell vapes and vaping related products to earn money and grow your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Manage The Shop:</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order products, stock the shelves, and serve customers at the checkout. Run every part of the store and reinvest the profits into shop upgrades.<br>Brand Deals: Sign contracts with brands to gain access to new products to sell. The more variety you have, the more customers you will attract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/eb209133c9f68a827434dca1bdc7462f.poster.avif?t=1747953554\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/eb209133c9f68a827434dca1bdc7462f.webm?t=1747953554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/eb209133c9f68a827434dca1bdc7462f.mp4?t=1747953554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Expand Your Business:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your store in size and in profit. Increase the amount of floor space available to support more quantity and variety of stock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/e96e219a4371894124bb2c888d15e56c.poster.avif?t=1747953554\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/e96e219a4371894124bb2c888d15e56c.webm?t=1747953554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/e96e219a4371894124bb2c888d15e56c.mp4?t=1747953554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hire Employees:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the workload. Increase your shops productivity by having employees perform tasks like operating the checkouts or stocking the shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/aab60e31f3d2cc08b5e3e9d7aeaebecc.poster.avif?t=1747953554\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/aab60e31f3d2cc08b5e3e9d7aeaebecc.webm?t=1747953554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/aab60e31f3d2cc08b5e3e9d7aeaebecc.mp4?t=1747953554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Protect Your Business:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your profits from thieves who will try to take from your shop and leave without paying.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vape Shop Simulator is a first-person simulation game where you sell vapes and vaping related products to earn money and grow your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Manage The Shop:</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order products, stock the shelves, and serve customers at the checkout. Run every part of the store and reinvest the profits into shop upgrades.<br>Brand Deals: Sign contracts with brands to gain access to new products to sell. The more variety you have, the more customers you will attract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/eb209133c9f68a827434dca1bdc7462f.poster.avif?t=1747953554\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/eb209133c9f68a827434dca1bdc7462f.webm?t=1747953554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/eb209133c9f68a827434dca1bdc7462f.mp4?t=1747953554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Expand Your Business:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your store in size and in profit. Increase the amount of floor space available to support more quantity and variety of stock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/e96e219a4371894124bb2c888d15e56c.poster.avif?t=1747953554\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/e96e219a4371894124bb2c888d15e56c.webm?t=1747953554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/e96e219a4371894124bb2c888d15e56c.mp4?t=1747953554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hire Employees:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the workload. Increase your shops productivity by having employees perform tasks like operating the checkouts or stocking the shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/aab60e31f3d2cc08b5e3e9d7aeaebecc.poster.avif?t=1747953554\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/aab60e31f3d2cc08b5e3e9d7aeaebecc.webm?t=1747953554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/aab60e31f3d2cc08b5e3e9d7aeaebecc.mp4?t=1747953554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Protect Your Business:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your profits from thieves who will try to take from your shop and leave without paying.</p>",
